>>
Rule 1 (dropout probability must be within [0, 1])
{v_1 : float} |= 0 ≤ v_1 ∧ v_1 ≤ 1
>>
Rule 2 (input must be 3D or 4D with batch and channel dimensions present)
{v_3 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_3) = 4 ∨ ndim(v_3) = 3) ∧ shape(v_3, 0) > 0 ∧ shape(v_3, 1) > 0
>>
Rule 3 (spatial/temporal dimensions must be positive depending on rank)
{v_3 : tensor} |= (if ndim(v_3) = 4 then shape(v_3, 2) > 0 ∧ shape(v_3, 3) > 0) ∧ (if ndim(v_3) = 3 then shape(v_3, 2) > 0)
>>
Rule 4 (no empty dimensions in the input tensor)
{v_3 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_3) - 1] : shape(v_3, i) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (inplace flag is a boolean)
{v_2 : bool} |= v_2 = true ∨ v_2 = false
